# Folder Structure & Architecture Rules

## Architecture Pattern
- Follow the Clean/Layered Architecture pattern inside `src/`.
- Routes MUST stay inside `src/presentation/routes/`.
- Controllers/Handlers MUST stay inside `src/presentation/controllers/`.
- Database models & schemas MUST stay inside `prisma/`.

## File Naming Conventions
- Route files: `*.route.js` (e.g., `branch.route.js`)
- Controller files: `*.controller.js`
- Service files: `*.service.js`

## Database & Migration Safeguards
- Do NOT change, add, or delete any database schema fields or Prisma models without explicit user consent.
- Do NOT run database migrations or schema sync commands (e.g., `prisma migrate`, `prisma db push`) without explicit approval.

## API Documentation
- After adding, changing, or removing any endpoint (route, request/response shape, or params), update `docs/openapi.yml` in the same change so it stays in sync with the implementation.